			\frac{-4x_2}{r^2}dx-8b_2\delta+16b_2\alpha\sqrt{\epsilon}-2a\pi b_2\sqrt{\epsilon}+O(\delta\sqrt{\epsilon})+ o(\sqrt{\epsilon})\\
