		On the other hand, integrating by parts, we get
		\begin{align*}
			&\int_{M\cap\{ r\geq\delta\}}
			\nabla_g G \nabla_g\left(\eta_\delta (4\log r-2\log (\epsilon+r_\epsilon^2))\right)\,dv_g\\
			&=-\frac{4\pi}{|M|} \int_{M\cap\{ r\geq\delta\}}
